        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;You’re on the front lines of the kitchen now.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, Manager! 『Burger Daily Mate』 is not your average cooking simulation. It’s a first-person 3D cooking survival simulation, blending high-stakes tension with comical chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍔 A 7-Day Survival Game: Save the Shop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You impulsively quit your corporate job to buy a burger joint. But reality hits hard: you have just 7 days to pay the rent. You must hit your daily sales targets to keep the doors open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hands-on with every step—grill patties, deep-fry fries, and pour drinks to feel the true &quot;art of the flip.&quot; One small mistake can trigger a completely different customer reaction, dialing up the tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🤯 The Customer is the Villain! Survive the Chaos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As soon as the day begins, waves of customer orders will test your sanity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmare Customer Events: Sudden, absurd incidents will block your view or disrupt your workflow.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild Custom Orders: The demands get crazier by the minute, testing your judgment and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must react fast to the unpredictable chaos just to keep the business running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After service, unlock new recipes and ingredients, complete challenges, and prep for the next day. The goal: master the controls, choose your upgrades, and survive all 7 days to save your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍔 Flip. Stack. Survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the kitchen chaos and see if you have what it takes!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;You’re on the front lines of the kitchen now.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, Manager! 『Burger Daily Mate』 is not your average cooking simulation. It’s a first-person 3D cooking survival simulation, blending high-stakes tension with comical chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍔 A 7-Day Survival Game: Save the Shop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You impulsively quit your corporate job to buy a burger joint. But reality hits hard: you have just 7 days to pay the rent. You must hit your daily sales targets to keep the doors open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hands-on with every step—grill patties, deep-fry fries, and pour drinks to feel the true &quot;art of the flip.&quot; One small mistake can trigger a completely different customer reaction, dialing up the tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🤯 The Customer is the Villain! Survive the Chaos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As soon as the day begins, waves of customer orders will test your sanity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmare Customer Events: Sudden, absurd incidents will block your view or disrupt your workflow.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild Custom Orders: The demands get crazier by the minute, testing your judgment and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must react fast to the unpredictable chaos just to keep the business running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After service, unlock new recipes and ingredients, complete challenges, and prep for the next day. The goal: master the controls, choose your upgrades, and survive all 7 days to save your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍔 Flip. Stack. Survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the kitchen chaos and see if you have what it takes!</p>",
        "short_description": "햄버거 가게 사장이 되어보세요. 패티 굽기, 감자튀김, 음료 추출 등 모든 조리 과정에 직접 개입하여 생생한 '손맛'을 느낄 수 있습니다. 7일 안에 월세를 내기 위해 매일의 가혹한 매출 데드라인을 달성해야 합니다. 제한된 시간 속에서 주방을 마스터하고 나만의 가게를 지켜내는 성취감을 느껴보세요.",
